{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10007","headline":"三月三日曲江侍宴 · 赵良器","name":"三月三日曲江侍宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣祖发神谋，灵符叶帝求。\n一人光锡命，万国荷时休。\n雷解圜丘毕，云需曲水游。\n岸花迎步辇，仙仗拥行舟。\n睿藻天中降，恩波海外流。\n小臣同品物，陪此乐皇猷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵良器","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10007.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10007","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}